<title>USA: NYSE December short interest rises 85 mln shares.</title>
<headline>NYSE December short interest rises 85 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said short interest in the month ended December 15 rose to 2,877,674,521 shares, an increase of 85,468,077 from the last month.</p>
<p>December's total is a new record for the NYSE, beating November's previous all-time high of 2,792,206,444.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
